<DocsExample TExample="ColorPickerBasicExample" Title="Choosing a color" Description="Drag in the area to set saturation and brightness, use the hue slider, or switch between Hex, RGB, and HSL entry. Bind the hex string with @@bind-Value." />
<DocsExample TExample="ColorPickerAlphaExample" Title="Opacity" Description="ShowAlpha adds an opacity slider and alpha entry. Colors below 100% opacity use the eight digit #rrggbbaa form." />
<DocsExample TExample="ColorPickerStatesExample" Title="Disabled" Description="A disabled picker keeps its color visible but ignores pointer and keyboard input." />
